abstract: >-
  Code, data and checks for the paper Reflexive Descent to Minimal Seeds in the
  Kreuzer-Skarke List: the depths D_2 = 5 and D_3 = 11, the bounds
  22 <= D_4 <= 50 and H_4 <= 348 with the certificate replay over all
  473,800,776 reflexive polytopes of dimension four, and the additivity of
  depths under free sums.
